ary.md","text":"# Reimbursement Summary\n\n## Checkpoint 3 — Reimbursement totals\n\n- **Reimbursable total: $1,056.00**\n- **Non-reimbursable total: $225.00**\n\nReimbursable arithmetic: $480.00 (T-001) + $0.00 (T-002) + $440.00 (T-003) + $58.00 (T-004) + $60.00 (T-005) + $0.00 (T-006) + $18.00 (T-007) = **$1,056.00**.\n\nNon-reimbursable arithmetic: $45.00 (T-002) + $70.00 (T-003) + $18.00 (T-004) + $10.00 (T-005) + $82.00 (T-006) = **$225.00**. Reconciliation: $1,056.00 + $225.00 = $1,281.00 total claimed.\n\n- **Fully approved:** T-001, T-007\n- **Partially reimbursed or capped:** T-003, T-004, T-005\n- **Rejected:** T-002, T-006","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":14,"totalLines":14,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md","time":{"start":1790565267459,"end":1790565267462}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d9917304ef2a2c1016ab9db934e3c87d28c3b8af2526d6590"}},"id":"prt_0e601b7e3001Oz4TpwfiHMyi4O","sessionID":"ses_f19ff5269ffeWS83Lv5ueXIeyF","messageID":"msg_0e601a355001jSsrr2BqWHUl76"}}
